# The Android build's working directories.
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
#
# NOTE that the repository root .gitignore already carries `build*/`, which
# covers android/build and android/app/build. The rest of these have no
# counterpart there.

# Gradle's own caches and the daemon's per-project state.
.gradle/

# AGP's native build metadata: the generated ninja files, CMake caches and
# compile_commands.json, one tree per ABI per build type. Regenerated by any
# configure and several megabytes of it.
app/.cxx/

# THE SDK LOCATION, and it must never be committed. It is an absolute path on
# one machine - and this project is built from WSL and from Windows, where it
# is a different path entirely. AGP finds the SDK through ANDROID_HOME when
# this file is absent, which is exactly what `. ~/android-env.sh` provides.
local.properties

# A signed release needs a keystore and its passwords. Neither exists yet;
# this is here so that the day one does, it cannot be added by accident.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
